     The keyframes are what I wrote. The tweens are a guess at what lay
     between, made the way the pieces are made: each letter travels toward
     where it reappears, and blurs while it moves.


     seven pieces, 18:28, each one a single ffmpeg command

     side one   the eye learns to see motion

     01  TWO FLASHES                                              1:12
